Use:

PEP8

Type hints

Dataclasses or Pydantic where appropriate

Pathlib

Logging

Meaningful docstrings

Short functions

Avoid:

Nested logic

Global variables

Hard-coded paths

Repeated code

Prefer:

Small reusable modules

Pure functions

Dependency injection where useful

Readable code over clever code.

Run Ruff formatting before considering work complete.
